way your smile moves when you talk or laugh."}],["$","h3","1",{"className":"text-balance font-display tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mt-9 text-2xl sm:text-[1.65rem]","children":"What Can Cosmetic Dentistry Address?"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"Cosmetic treatments help improve both form and confidence. Maybe you’re bothered by discoloration that whitening strips can’t fix, or you have a chipped tooth that catches your eye in photos. Cosmetic dentistry, courtesy of your dentist in Wyoming, OH, can correct uneven shapes, fill small gaps, and restore balance to your smile. Even older dental work can be updated for a fresher, more seamless look that blends perfectly with your natural teeth."}],["$","h3","3",{"className":"text-balance font-display tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mt-9 text-2xl sm:text-[1.65rem]","children":"Personalized Treatment Options"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"No two smiles are alike, and no two treatment plans should be either. For quick, visible results, professional whitening can lift deep stains safely. Tooth-colored bonding smooths chips and evens edges with minimal preparation. Veneers and crowns go a step further, reshaping and strengthening teeth while maintaining a natural appearance. If alignment is the concern, clear aligner therapy offers gradual correction without metal brackets or wires. Each treatment is customized to achieve lasting comfort and harmony."}],["$","h3","5",{"className":"text-balance font-display tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mt-9 text-2xl sm:text-[1.65rem]","children":"What to Expect During Your Visit?"}],"$L20","$L21"]}]]}],"$L22"]}]}]
