20:["$","p","6",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"Your first visit is all about understanding your goals. The dentist will take time to discuss your concerns, review photos, and perform a thorough exam to map out the right approach. You’ll get an honest look at your options, along with timelines, costs, and what kind of maintenance to expect. Everything is explained clearly, so you can make informed decisions that feel right for you."}]
21:["$","p","7",{"className":"mt-4 text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:text-base sm:leading-8","children":"Cosmetic dentistry at Wyoming Family Dentistry won’t make you have a perfect smile, but there’s no such thing—what we hope is that cosmetic dentistry services in Wyoming, OH at Wyoming Family Dentistry will help you rediscover comfort and confidence in your own smile. We want you to smile, speak and laugh freely, knowing that your teeth and gums look healthy and attractive. With thoughtful planning and skilled care, your results look natural, feel strong, and last for years. When you’re ready, we’ll help you take that next step toward a smile that feels unmistakably yours."}]
